            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Khai Huong",
            "review_text": "Trí Anh Phùng\nTampere, Finland17 contributions\n0\nDecent seafoods but expectedly with a high price\nAug 2019\nOne sketchy thing about the restaurant is that it does not have a menu. A waiter will tell you food options and the price. I do not think he can speak English well. So if you are a foreign tourists, this place is not recommended.\n\nWe ordered octopus and clam, each had the price of ~300k for 500g. But the two dishes were not enough to satisfy 4 people (2 men 2 women); we ended up having a big bowl of rice, fried pork, and vegetable soup.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 4, 2019",
